      "title": "Price target decreased by 7.1% to ₹400",
      "body": "Down from ₹430, the current price target is an average from 17 analysts. New target price is 36% above last closing price of ₹293. Stock is down 12% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹11.34 for next year compared to ₹10.07 last year.",
